{
  "_doc": "keyteki `when: { onXxx: (event, context) => … }` keys → our Trigger. subject = the expression that names the card (or player) the event is about; the lambda is read against it with the filter library (lambdas.mjs). status: ok = lowered in M1; pending = recognised, lowered in M2 (patterns/events).",
